  "body": "Removes residual personal data missed by the prior de-identification pass (PR #47):\n\n- **host_census.json**: a file-hash key contained an email-shaped filename; replaced with a neutral key. JSON parses cleanly.\n- **pirate_spore.png**: the spore payload's `identity.author` still read `Jody` (PR #47 patched only the iTXt metadata chunk). Regenerated the PNG from canonical state per the spore update protocol (never edit pixels in place) with author `Mantle OS contributors`; `verify_spore` passes.\n\nVerified: no name/email remains in either file.",
